    "text": "<p>As per the given figure, if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>,&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>AB</mi></msub></math> at this instant will be ______&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3740cdb7-c9d5-488d-b8cf-b2e6b61203f1-9895771.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 239px;\" />&nbsp;</p>",
