  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2c3e63cf-9257-483e-9de6-27578797f78b-9895771_2.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 243px;\" /></p><p>Given here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Applying Kirchhoff&#39;s voltage law to the circuit,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>L</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;</p>",
